Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The Land of Truth Tellers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But on the map, it says--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It changed to that name six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,As the name says, it has\Nbecome a country with no liars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:29.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you enter our territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,even if you're a witch,\Nyour body will not be able to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:36.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Why in the world did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.21,0:00:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's because of the mysterious\Npower of the sword the king has.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.71,0:00:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,With the power of his sword brimming with magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:48.58,Main,,0,0,0,,he has put up a barrier around the whole\Ncountry to keep those within from lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:51.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That seems kind of shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:54.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Witch, you are already being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:00:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you enter the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.63,0:01:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm still of two minds, and still suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:09.13,Main,,0,0,0,,but it sounds like it'll make\Na good story, so I'll try going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:10.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}are {\i0}honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Land of Truth Tellers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:15.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome to this damned country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:58.00,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Land of Truth Tellers"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.25,0:03:04.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The Land of Truth Tellers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like a normal town, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,For now, I'll test whether or not I can lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll try saying "I am not beautiful."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I am not beauti--beauti--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I am very beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my mouth moved on its own to tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:35.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like what they said\Nabout not being able to lie was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:41.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may,\Nit's kind of quiet around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder why no one's talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Those look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Are these freshly baked?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll take one, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,So hard... What's with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard and dry. It's probably\Nunsold bread leftover from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:11.88,Main,,0,0,0,,She made it sound like\Nit was freshly baked, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What's so honest about this country anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Since they said there are\Nonly honest people here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I was imagining that the people\Nwould be more pure, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:23.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like I was wrong, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Instead, they seem kind of distant,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,and things seem kind of tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what made the king\Ndecide to change the country like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,"You're the witch dispatched from\Nthe United Magic Association, right?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:50.54,Main,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, the United Magic\NAssociation is a mysterious organization
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,that meddles in everything\Nthat deals with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:05:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Those affiliated with the association\Nhave a brooch shaped like a moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:09.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? What about if it's written down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it still not possible to lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:25.08,Main,,0,0,0,,"New sweets! Actually, we just added\Nsome new things to old products."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,"A mystery woven by a new author!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Even that bestselling author\Nwas shocked by how boring it was!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:41.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll try writing "I have a twisted\Npersonality" and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:45.58,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"I have a pure heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. You can't even lie through writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:51.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're pigheaded, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You scheming bastard! You should just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You bellyacher! {\i1}You {\i0}should die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,--What did you say?! I can't believe you\Nwent after a woman so out of your league!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh my, just when I finally heard some\Nvoices, it turns out it was an argument.\N--What did you say?! I can't believe you\Nwent after a woman so out of your league!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh my, just when I finally heard some\Nvoices, it turns out it was an argument.\N--Yeah, I was sure she liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, is it all right to let them go on like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It helps us release stress, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,In fact, I wish they'd do it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:22.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Why won't the people in this country talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Because if we talk,\Nsince we can only tell the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:28.38,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll end up fighting like that, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Witch, are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,See? All of this is that stupid king's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:06:59.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you please not have\Na fist fight in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't any of you stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,...them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd see you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this fate? It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:37.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to get married, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Putting that aside, it's been\Na long time, hasn't it, Saya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:43.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you seem to be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,...and this treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:52.21,Main,,0,0,0,,...I'm doing very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.88,0:07:57.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I was able to become a witch, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What's your witch title?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The Charcoal Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Charcoal, huh? It's a little\Nlike my "Ashen Witch."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:15.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I asked my teacher\Nto choose a word close to "ashen."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you part of the United Magic Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:26.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it was the easiest way\Nto make money as I traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in this country for work, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I bought something a little pricey,\Nso I need to work a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:38.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I met someone earlier who was\Nlooking for a witch from the association.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, what did they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't get a name or address in the request...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You incompetent witch! You're back again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:52.67,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Eek! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's that\Nweird person over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's that weird person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:09:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could let go of me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Um... You were looking for a witch\Ndispatched by the association, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you to my friend, Saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,"Friend" sounds so formal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,"Sorry. I was in a hurry, so I forgot\Nto write my name and address."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:42.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Eihemia, is it that you can't talk,\Nor that you won't talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:47.71,Main,,0,0,0,,"I lost my voice because of certain reasons."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going to write all the reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, this looks like it'll take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:58.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Eihemia then told us about those reasons--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No, she wrote them. From what she wrote--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.13,Main,,0,0,0,,About six months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:09.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Eihemia, a witch who worked in the palace,\Nreceived a request from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Quicksand Witch, Eihemia,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,please use your power to get\Nrid of all the liars in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.13,0:10:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,All my retainers are liars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:25.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I only want people near me who\Nwill say what they really think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.92,0:10:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:34.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If I can help the king, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:45.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I just have to put up a barrier\Nthat won't let people lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:49.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Eihemia found a suitable sword in the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,and tried to make it a vessel\Nfor the magic of the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:11:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ianesana-ha, ianesana-ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:03.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Ominano motera-do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,But she needed a large amount\Nof magic to perform the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:12.63,Main,,0,0,0,,--Eihemia poured in all her magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,--Ominano motera-do!\N--Eihemia poured in all her magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:19.75,Main,,0,0,0,,but that wasn't enough,\Nso she even gave up her voice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,to complete the barrier sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder why people who\Nare trying to accomplish things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:29.00,Main,,0,0,0,,end up giving up their voices\Nor memories in exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:29.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just talking to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? A barrier sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that if\NI hold this in my dominant hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I can put up a barrier that will prevent\Npeople from lying in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,A land of truth tellers, huh? Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:12:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But man, this sword is really lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so gaudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though it's to put up the barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I have\Nto hold a sword like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, the Land of Truth Tellers was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, since Eihemia\Ncouldn't use magic anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,she was thrown out of the palace\Nbecause she was now incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:28.08,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"I didn't have any worth other than my magic..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You were hired as a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,so of course you would be\Nvalued mostly for your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:38.58,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Even so, I'd been hoping that\Nhe would still keep me by his side."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing that you gave up all\Nyour magic and even your voice
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,could be overwhelming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:47.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's what put off the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,So, your request is to put this country\Nback to what it was before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:54.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do to put it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:13:00.08,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Just destroy the king's sword. Then, my magic\Nand voice will return to normal, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:01.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Should I aim for when the king\Ncomes out of the castle or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:08.38,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"He will make a speech in one month."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina! Let's stay in\Nthe same room for one month
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,and eat and sleep together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, and bathe together, and we might\Nas well go to the bathroom together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and sleep in the same bed--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's come up with a different plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:23.54,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Going into the palace might be the best bet."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:28.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But if we can't lie, don't you\Nthink it would be hard to get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like we can get in from the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,and security looks tight...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:38.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Land of Truth Tellers,\Nso it'd be hard to get in by lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,But.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:41.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:44.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We can use that and make it work somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:46.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,A picture is worth a thousand words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What business do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:59.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You may not enter the palace\Nwithout permission from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You're back again?\NYou've been banished from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:09.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, Saya, please explain the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahem. Mr. Doorman, do you\Nunderstand what is written here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,"The banishment
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.25,Main,,0,0,0,,of the witch, Eihemia,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,has been revoked,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:25.54,Main,,0,0,0,,and she is to enter the palace\Nwith Elaina, the Ashen Witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,and Saya, the Charcoal Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We have the permission
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,of the king"? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Land of Truth Tellers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't lie, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.92,Main,,0,0,0,,May we enter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that worked! As expected of Miss Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:50.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.83,0:14:52.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We just had to write\Nthe sentences down in chunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Since none of the parts contained\Nany lies, they could be written down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:01.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, they just had to\Nbe read in the right order,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,and we could write anything we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The pen really is mightier than the sword, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Eihemia, where's the throne room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,There?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:24.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, could you be the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let go of that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:31.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What? There are three witches!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,One of them's Eihemia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:42.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Man, this is such a pain, and I'm sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:46.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That witch has a flat chest,\Nbut she's pretty cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The boyish witch over here's my type!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I already have\Nmy heart set on someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya, I will take the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Please do something about the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Saya, the Charcoal Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.04,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"I am a non-combatant."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.17,0:16:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Please hand over the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:10.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,This sword is the greatest weapon,\Nmade to guide this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as I have this, I can lead\Nthis country in the correct direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,So mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:31.25,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"That sword can release stored\Nmagic, so please be careful."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:33.92,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"It'll hurt a lot if it hits you."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.50,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"It'll hurt a lot if it hits you."\NPlease tell us that first next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:36.38,MainTop,,0,0,0,,\NPlease tell us that first next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Did getting rid of lies
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,make this country any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course it did!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:01.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,People with evil intent can\Ndo evil things without lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Just because this country\Nbecame full of truth tellers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:14.17,Main,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean that everyone in\Nthis country became a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:17.79,Main,,0,0,0,,And not all liars are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Sometimes white lies can act as lubricant
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,to smooth over relationships between people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:27.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Without that, people just grate on\Neach other's nerves and become tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:29.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:32.83,Main,,0,0,0,,If the sword is the truth,\Nthen lies are the scabbard (saya).
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:34.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking to you.\NI was talking about a sword scabbard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:44.38,Main,,0,0,0,,If the sword is truth, then lies\Nare the scabbard for that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:47.67,Main,,0,0,0,,To keep us from swinging the truth\Naround recklessly and hurting people,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,the truth is wrapped in lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You little... Babbling on like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,There are too many enemies!\NI can't take care of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:18:01.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like my brain's going to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.17,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Do your best!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like Saya is at her limit, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,so let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,End this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Haven't you had to use everything\Nyou've got just to hold back my attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:14.83,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:18.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I've already been prepared\Nto take that sword from you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:38.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The really lame sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:44.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it, Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you saying... that I was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Eihemia...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Your desire to be honest is not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But from now on, why don't you relax a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,...and lie and be lied to as\Nyou govern this land... okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:43.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Fresh bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want some fresh fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You really are a good guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,And you've really got some guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The king recognized his own mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and apologized to the country's citizens\Nfor making it so they couldn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.13,0:20:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know if the country\Nwill go back to how it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,but Eihemia is back at the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.63,0:20:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,so I'm sure it'll all work out, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Witches, thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, the association's rules state
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,that I must give you a present\Nto thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:24.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.21,0:20:28.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If you do everything by the book,\Nthen you'll become inflexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,But please let me thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nothing big, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,A necklace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I bought this with all the money I had\Non hand to give you when I saw you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:49.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I took this job because I'd run out of money,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,but that's how I got to see\Nyou again, so it must be fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Please think of it as me and treasure it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:58.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Your feelings are overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,But, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.04,0:21:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll put it on for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:04.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:06.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:19.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:22.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Now we match!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I need to head to\Nthe association branch office.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:30.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Where will you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to another unknown town somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:43.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a promise charm that\Nis used in my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Please hook your pinky in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:53.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:56.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to introduce you to my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:22:01.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and I'll be a better witch by then, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll wait patiently as I travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:08.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I promise.
